R9	Speaker Arg1:T3 Arg2:T7	
T8	Quotation 514 698	"Not at all. This gentleman, Mr. Wilson, has been my partner and helper in many of my most successful cases, and I have no doubt that he will be of the utmost use to me in yours also."
R10	Speaker Arg1:T2 Arg2:T8	
R11	Addressee Arg1:T3 Arg2:T8	
