R406	Speaker Arg1:T289 Arg2:T290	
T291	Quotation 26248 26540	"Then put on your hat and come. I am going through the City first, and we can have some lunch on the way. I observe that there is a good deal of German music on the programme, which is rather more to my taste than Italian or French. It is introspective, and I want to introspect. Come along!"
