T351	Cue 34550 34554	said
T352	Entity 34555 34567	the stranger
R490	Cueing Arg1:T351 Arg2:T350	
R491	Speaker Arg1:T352 Arg2:T350	
R492	Addressee Arg1:T348 Arg2:T350	
T353	Quotation 34584 34714	"Still, I confess that I miss my rubber. It is the first Saturday night for seven-and-twenty years that I have not had my rubber."
R493	Cueing Arg1:T351 Arg2:T353	
