T356	Entity 34745 34760	Sherlock Holmes
T357	Quotation 34762 35026	"that you will play for a higher stake to-night than you have ever done yet, and that the play will be more exciting. For you, Mr. Merryweather, the stake will beDONEDET53930,000 pounds; and for you, Jones, it will be the man upon whom you wish to lay your hands."
R496	Cueing Arg1:T355 Arg2:T354	
R497	Cueing Arg1:T355 Arg2:T357	
R498	Speaker Arg1:T356 Arg2:T354	
R499	Speaker Arg1:T356 Arg2:T357	
