T383	Quotation 38771 38795	"It is our French gold,"
T384	Cue 38796 38805	whispered
T385	Entity 38806 38818	the director
R536	Cueing Arg1:T384 Arg2:T383	
R537	Speaker Arg1:T385 Arg2:T383	
